===Etymology===
{{root|la|ine-pro|*h₁eḱ-}}
{{PIE word|la|h₁éḱwos}}
{{etymon|la|inh|itc-pro>*ekwos>horse|id=horse}}
For {{inh|la|itc-pro|*ekwos}}, from {{inh|la|ine-pro|*h₁éḱwos||horse}}, cognate with {{cog|grc|ἵππος}}, {{cog|sa|अश्व|tr=áśva}}, {{cog|fa|اسب|tr=asb}}, {{cog|xcl|էշ||donkey}}, {{cog|txb|yakwe}}, {{cog|cel-gau|epos}}. Respelt with <small>QVV</small> for the earlier <small>QVO/CV</small> in post-Augustan times on the analogy of oblique cases.

